# Indonesian text localization checkpoint

Updated: 2026-10-10. Game: No, I'm not a Human v1.3.19. Locale: `id`; source build locale: `ru`; delivery type: standard. This checkpoint covers text only. The owner excluded translated images and textures and directed text drafting before further game runtime testing.

## Current correction cycle 3 checkpoint (2026-10-10)

Independent reviewer `/root/id_independent_review_02` read all 324 cycle-02 delta pairs plus three supplemental dependencies. Its pinned evidence records three full-unit female-friend omissions and a selector defect: `подруж*` was absent from the source-variant pattern, causing two unreviewed daughter introductions and one incorrectly retired callback. All nine cycle-02 replacements were accepted; `mimpi` remains supported and the Fatman singular-object proposal remains rejected. The source, glossary, accepted inventory and first full 16,538-unit semantic pass are unchanged.

All three review-02 text findings were accepted as complete replacements and applied together to three Indonesian authored dialogue batches. The locale-owned current canonical [v3 selector](closure-selector-recipe-v3.py) and [configuration](closure-selector-config-v3.json) now cover `подруг*` and `подруж*`, derive `phone_sub_DaughtersFriend` from the compiled `GetPhoneNumber` contact token, and restore the daughter callback by normal selection. Three affected batch validators, all 332 current sidecars, the full 16,538-row preserve-exact gate, both common-choice recipe verifications and static TMP validation passed. The prior/current diff is exactly three stable IDs. Text draft coverage remains **16,538/16,538 (100%)**, separate from editorial and runtime readiness.

The immutable [cycle-03 handoff](semantic-correction-cycle-03/independent-delta-handoff.json) has SHA-256 `4cb35752e6f7a8cb19fb9657b1adea085c3ef133aa59b45a00f1cd1ffad41933`. The current closure has **1,414 IDs** (SHA-256 `6489d453612e70fcc1ace025df924d86ded7c968be4a74cc4db7187c9bec8eb2`). The exact next independent set has **21 IDs** (SHA-256 `662678567b5bf8984d1df69b700277bf5c718140c7d7870437bcddcde26e7510`): three corrected IDs, 19 new dependencies and one explicitly invalidated prior UI label, with two corrected IDs overlapping the new set. The 38 retired prior dependencies, restored callback and applicability of the 845-ID mandatory regression union are recorded separately. `correction-progress.json` is the mutable current pointer. A distinct reviewer must inspect this delta; author validation is not independent acceptance. Runtime, dynamic value execution, rendered layout and fonts remain untested; translated images and textures are excluded.

## Historical correction cycle 2 checkpoint (2026-10-10)

The source, accepted inventory, preserve-exact manifest, approved Indonesian layer and canonical Russian glossary retain the pinned hashes below. The first independent reviewer `/root/id_independent_review_01` read all 2,182 cycle-01 closure rows on unchanged hashes, found nine objective defects, and statically resolved `message_bodyEaterVisit` in favor of `mimpi`. The Fatman singular-object proposal remains rejected. No source, glossary, parser, runtime binding or stable-ID mapping changed, so the complete first semantic pass remains reusable.

All nine independent proposals were accepted as full-unit corrections after scene, branch, consumer and glossary adjudication. They were applied together to eight authored Indonesian batches. Eight affected batch validators passed. The full 16,538-row preserve-exact validator passed; all 332 target/static sidecars match their current inputs. The two generated choice batches reproduce from unchanged authored maps, and static TMP validation passed 178 rows. Full diff verification found exactly nine changed stable IDs and zero unrelated target changes. Translation draft coverage is still 16,538/16,538 (100%), separate from editorial and runtime readiness.

The locale-owned `closure-selector-recipe.py` with `closure-selector-config-v2.json` generates and verifies the immutable cycle-02 evidence. Its regression cases cover the UI KChS document noun plus all 245 reporting-action variants, the mycelium/clumps antecedent, Bestson’s breastfeeding cause, and the intervening beer-ad line. The current closure has 1,433 IDs. Against the 2,182 previously reviewed IDs, the next independent set is exactly 324: nine corrected IDs, 314 new dependencies, and one explicitly invalidated prior mushroom-transition ID. The 1,063 retired previous dependencies are listed separately. Current mandatory regression evidence covers 836 deduplicated IDs.

The compact [cycle-02 v2 handoff](semantic-correction-cycle-02/independent-delta-handoff-v2.json) is pinned at SHA-256 `8631d56a85333dad4d36ae20ab9c31b5b187d7b322a3cff96cd9a56bb4b1c053`; `correction-progress.json` is the mutable current pointer. Its source-only phone scene addendum contains 60 unaccepted candidates that clarify the female friend and answering mother, with zero effect on the 16,538-unit denominator or 324-ID review set. Root assigns the next reviewer. No clean independent delta review or editorial acceptance has been claimed. The game, dynamic values and rendered layout were not exercised; translated images and textures remain excluded.

## Historical correction cycle 1 checkpoint (2026-10-09)

