All 62 affected batch validators passed. The corrected corpus passed the complete 16,538-row preserve-exact check; 332 current batch/static validation sidecars match their inputs. Both common-choice expansions reproduce from their authored maps, and the static draft validator passed. A comparison against all 35 immutable first-pass parts found exactly the 83 accepted changed IDs and zero other changed units. The original first-pass reviewed file hashes remain a pre-correction snapshot in `semantic-review-progress.json`; current exact file hashes are in `semantic-correction-cycle-01/artifact-manifest.json`.

